		"name": "Ayar Souq - Metals Prices API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Ayar Souq metals pricing endpoints including spot prices, historical data, and Sudan exchange rate management.\n\n## Base URL\n`{{baseUrl}}/AyarSouqAPIs/api/metals-prices`\n\n## Features\n- Real-time metals prices (Gold, Silver, Platinum)\n- Historical price data (7d, 1m, 3m periods)\n- Multi-country currency support\n- Sudan exchange rate management\n- Carat calculations for gold (24k, 22k, 21k, 18k, 14k)\n\n## Environment Variables\n- `baseUrl`: Your server base URL (e.g., https://ayarsouq.com)\n\n## API Optimization\n- Redis caching for performance\n- Optimized API calls (3 requests/day vs 5)\n- Fallback mechanisms for reliability",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "12345678"
	},
